import json
from pathlib import Path
T=json.loads(Path('src/timing.json').read_text())
visuals=[
 ('Who checks?','Oversized editorial question; tilted answer sheet; animated text strokes and highlighter; a magnifying lens enters the foreground.','Anticipated title lift, independent paper and loupe transforms; small camera push.','Low hook impact at 0.1s; tick at 2.8s.'),
 ('A job is a bundle.','One conceptual job is separated into three illustrated, independently tilted task cards: READ, WRITE, DECIDE.','Staggered vertical card entrance, subtle paper depth, connector brackets.','Swipe starts 4.12s; card tick at 6.1s.'),
 ('AI can help with parts.','Three connected workflow rows: read / find key points; write / first draft; decide / review result. AI badges on the first two, human review on the last.','Staggered rows; line and check draws; conceptual labels, no employment statistics.','Swipe 8.62s; downbeat 9s; task/badge ticks 9.6, 10.333, 11.767s.'),
 ("Fluent isn't fact.",'Invert to ink background. A white output sheet is annotated coral; VERIFY IT stamp covers an illustrative passage.','Independent paper drift, highlight wipe, short stamp overshoot, held reading state.','Swipe starts 13.62s; stamp impact at 16s.'),
 ('Errors can travel.','Original six-node document network. Coral warnings propagate; CHECK BEFORE SHARING closes the diagram.','Progressive connector draws, then warning-color propagation. Explicitly conceptual, not a measured transmission rate.','Swipe 19.12s; propagation ticks 20.5,21.033,21.567s.'),
 ('What should we hand off?','Two paper boards contrast first drafts / repeatable steps with judgment / accountability. Both remain visible.','Staggered opposing card entries, shared lower connector and deliberate hold.','Swipe 24.62s; soft impact at 25s; decision tick at 27s.'),
 ('Keep the human.','Fingerprint-like original line work forms a human verification emblem. Warm lime check against ink; the closing phrase resolves.','Staggered path draws, small camera move, final held composition; score fades to silence.','Swipe 29.62s, check impact 31s; musical tail fades over last 1.1s.')]
s='# Frame-accurate storyboard\n\n1080 × 1920, 30 fps, exactly 1,050 frames. End frames below are inclusive; source JSON uses exclusive ends. All narration is generated before rendering.\n\n'
for t,(title,v,a,snd) in zip(T,visuals):
 s+=f"## {t['scene']+1}. {title}\n\nFrames **{t['startFrame']}–{t['endFrameExclusive']-1}**; {t['startFrame']/30:g}–{t['endFrameExclusive']/30:g}s.\n\nNarration: “{t['text']}”\n\nMeasured speech: {t['speechStart']:.3f}–{t['speechEnd']:.3f}s.\n\nVisual / overlays: {v}\n\nAnimation: {a}\n\nTransition: {'Coral-edged incoming illustrated page slides over the last 12 frames; next-scene reveals overlap the handoff. Repeated task/document motifs carry the argument.' if t['scene']<6 else 'Hold the human emblem through frame 1,049; no fade to a blank frame.'}\n\nSound: {snd} Original 120 BPM score; speech-keyed ducking throughout.\n\n"
s+='## Timing integrity\n\n`src/timing.json` is the authoritative scene and measured utterance map. Word timestamps are uniform estimates within each measured utterance, not forced alignment; captions are sentence-level. `audio/beat_map.json` contains the exact composition beat grid and effects cues; `audio/audio_analysis.json` contains actual Librosa onset detections. The beat grid is not misrepresented as a perfect beat-tracker output. Narration has priority over music. Schematic diagrams have no numerical axes or invented measurements.\n'
Path('docs/storyboard.md').write_text(s)
Path('docs/script.md').write_text('# AI can draft. Who checks?\n\n'+ '\n\n'.join(t['text'] for t in T)+'\n\n## Editorial position and factual scope\n\nA focused, conditional argument about generation and verification, not a prediction that AI replaces whole jobs. Read/write/decide is an illustrative task bundle, not a measured decomposition. “In seconds” is conversational, not a benchmark. The propagated-error network is explicitly conceptual. The closing is an editorial question about choice and accountability. Primary evidence and limitations are in VOX_STYLE_RESEARCH.md.\n\nVoice: locally synthesized Kokoro am_michael, speed .94, measured per utterance; pitch-preserving atempo only if a slot needs fitting. No human narrator or paid API is claimed.\n')
